<title>BELGIUM: Austria to raise allegations of Swiss beef subsidies.</title>
<headline>Austria to raise allegations of Swiss beef subsidies.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria is to raise allegations at next week's farm Council that Switzerland is undermining its exports of young cattle to  Italy by subsidising exports, an EU official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Austrians want to raise the point under any other business at next week's farm council in Luxembourg,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>No decision can be taken on the allegation that the Swiss who, like Austria, are traditional exporters of young cattle to Italy may be using susidies which are lowering the price of the animals on the Italian market.</p>
<p>&quot;When this is raised we will certainly look into it,&quot; a senior Commission official said on Friday.</p>
</text>
